<name>Active Torque Control 4WD System</name>
<para id="X36100000I4008C" category="C" type-id="300UX" name-id="370EF-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1298/98</dtccode>
<dtcname>Linear Solenoid Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="X36100000I4008C_10" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00005IL00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>Based on the signals from each sensor, the 4WD computer assembly controls the transmitted torque of the electronically controlled coupling. This provides the optimum drive force distribution for the vehicle driving conditions.</ptxt>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.27in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="3.89in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="1.92in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1298/98</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>With IG1 voltage 9.5V or more and linear solenoid SLC command current 0A or 0.8A or more, an open or short circuit in the linear solenoid continues for 1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission Coupling Assembly (Linear Solenoid SLC)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness and Connector (Linear Solenoid SLC Circuit)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>4WD Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X36100000I4008C_11" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00005IM00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
