</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X36100000I4008C_12" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X36100000I4008C_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X36100000I4008C_13_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___00005IO00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Transmission Coupling Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG OFF and disconnect the transmission coupling assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the transmission coupling assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00150</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.57in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.19in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1(SLC+) - 2(SLC-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2.2 - 2.6Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X36100000I4008C_13_0001" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X36100000I4008C_13_0003" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X36100000I4008C_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00005IN00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (4WD Computer Assembly - Transmission Coupling Assembly [Linear Solenoid SLC])</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the transmission coupling assembly connector and disconnect the 4WD computer assembly connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C117072J12" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the vehicle side connector terminals of the 4WD computer assembly, and between the vehicle side connector terminals and body ground. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000068800EX"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
</test1>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C01" colwidth="1.93in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="C02" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.1in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Terminal No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>13(SLC+) - 32(SLC-)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2.2 to 2.6Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>13 (SLC+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>32 (SLC-) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
